          (u/lit :yang.call/invalid-invocation)\nsrc/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc:1618:                                           ;; `cell/authentic?`, and an unauthenticated\nsrc/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc:1621:                                                      (u/app (u/v 'cell/authentic?) (u/v callee))\nsrc/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc:2078:   is named from the outcome pass's counter when one is running, else from the\nsrc/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc:2480:                                    ;; `cell/authentic?` — the issuer's\nsrc/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc:2525:                                        (if (cell/authentic? dsg__candidate)\nsrc/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc:2649:;; What stays a host primitive, named by the `kind` module: a symbol, a\ntest/yang/core/call_test.cljc:68:                            :yang.call/named [[\"x\" 1] [\"x\" 2]]\ntest/yang/core/call_test.cljc:77:                            :yang.call/named [[1 :bad]]\ntest/yang/core/call_test.cljc:85:                            :yang.call/named []\ntest/yang/core/call_test.cljc:199:                            :yang.call/named []\nsrc/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/safepoint.cljc:17:   throws the guest value `js.sp/interrupt` builds (an Error object named\nsrc/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/safepoint.cljc:78:     ;; the value an interrupt throws: an Error named Interrupt, built from\nsrc/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/prelude.cljc:57:   emitter strips only the namespace `js/`, so no definition is named like\nsrc/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/prelude.cljc:59:   prelude is named like a definition.\nsrc/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/prelude.cljc:135:                   (if (if (js/cell? x) (cell/authentic? x) false)\nsrc/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/prelude.cljc:1613:                     (let [retained (js/retained-condition e)]\nsrc/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/prelude.cljc:1650:    ;; :yang.call/invalid-invocation and :yang.call/unsupported-binding map\nsrc/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/prelude.cljc:1659:    [js/retained-condition\nsrc/cljc/yang/types